<title>NORWAY: Statoil, Norsk Hydro swap areas.</title>
<headline>Statoil, Norsk Hydro swap areas.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Norway's Den norske stats oljeselskap AS (Statoil) said on Thursday it was assuming operator responsibility from Norsk Hydro ASA for block 15/5 north of the Sleipner area in the North Sea.</p>
<p>Part of an agreement between the two companies on swapping licence interests, the deal will also give Statoil eight percentage points from Hydro's 17.3 percent interest in the block, the company Status Weekly magazine said.</p>
</text>
